# Tape stops on a rising sweep: F3 (slowest, held to a halt), A#4 = 70 (fast, released half-way), E5 (fastest), at
# P1 100, P2 60.
tempo 120
steps 48
tail 0.5
track fx1
input sweep 200 2000 0.5
param p1 100
param p2 60
param pan 255
param level 255
gain 1
note 2 F3 14
note 24 70 2
note 34 E5 8
expect sound 0 48
expect peak_below 0
